flowchart TD
  X0["Noise x₀"] --> XT["Straight line:<br/>x_t = t·x₁ + (1−t)·x₀"]
  X1["Data x₁"] --> XT
  XT --> NET["Network v_θ(x_t, t)"]
  NET --> L["Loss: ‖v_θ − (x₁ − x₀)‖²<br/>no ODE solving in training"]
  NET --> SAMP["Sampling: integrate dx/dt = v<br/>from noise to data"]
  SAMP --> FEW["Straighter paths → fewer steps<br/>(rectified flow straightens further)"]
